Description: Guest-suite cabinet for The Lunduke Computer Operating System
 Sideboard lists EarBlaster, Read-O-Matic, YOLO-dex, Kablamo!, Ephemeris,
 Partyline, Dispatch, and itself; compares dpkg versions to GitHub Releases;
 and installs the published .deb. It is not an official LCOS updater.
